>
  <p>Sustainability is no longer a niche requirement; it is a global consumer expectation. At FITCLO, we are bridging the gap between recycled materials and professional-grade athletic support.</p>
  
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-10">
    <div class="p-6 bg-green-50 rounded-2xl text-center"><h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Recycled Nylon</h4><p class="text-[10px]">Repurposed from fishing nets and pre-consumer waste.</p></div>
    <div class="p-6 bg-green-50 rounded-2xl text-center"><h4 class="font-bold mb-2">rPET (Recycled Poly)</h4><p class="text-[10px]">Diverting plastic bottles from oceans into durable gear.</p></div>
