  <h3>Certifications Matter: GRS & OEKO-TEX</h3>
  <p>We provide full traceability for our eco-fabrics, including <strong>Global Recycled Standard (GRS)</strong> and <strong>OEKO-TEX Standard 100</strong>, ensuring your brand stands on verified environmental claims.</p>

  <h3>Can Eco-Fabrics Match 230GSM Interlock?</h3>
  <p>Modern recycled Nylon-66 provides the same tensile strength and hand-feel as virgin nylon. Professional athletes cannot distinguish the performance difference between standard interlock and our recycled variations.</p>

  <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl">
    <h3 class="text-[#C9A84C] mt-0">Build a Greener Brand</h3>
    <p>Download our 2026 Sustainable Fabric Catalog to see our full range of GRS-certified options and start your eco-collection.</p>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
